00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.600
Then, I'll leave things to you.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.490
Princess Mari!

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.620
Give my regards to your star Prince.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.700
Ask him to play favourites a little, would you?

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:24.670
Stupid...

