00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:42.600
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:43.760
Perfect!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.300
Grandma...

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:01.020
I found the recipe for the strawberry tart that was in your recipe book.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.490
But I've decided not to read it.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.140
Is that so?

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:14.590
I've decided to perfect my own strawberry
tart recipe, using my own abilities!

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:23.060
Ichigo, you've really gotten reliable, haven't you?

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.090
But you know, Ichigo...

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:35.600
You might be able to make delicious sweets just with a good recipe, but you can't make sweets that make people happy with only a recipe.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:49.250
What I was worried about, was you getting too fixated on the recipe, and forgetting about what's really important when making a strawberry tart.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.980
What's important is...

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:59.120
What? Grandma! I can't hear you!

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.930
What's more important?

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.510
Grandma!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:16.040
recipe 47

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:16.040
The Paris found in the Backyard

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.220
I tried making macarons.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:26.070
If you'd like, would you try these?

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:30.970
Why do the macarons have this part that looks like it's squeezing out?

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:34.370
That's called the pied and it's a special characteristic of macarons.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.820
It's actually quite hard to get them just right.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.800
How educational!

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:43.470
The gloss and the pied are excellent.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.280
The outside is crisp, and the inside, soft.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.950
These came out delicious.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:48.850
Thank you.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.910
Caramel, you're eating way too many yourself!

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.170
Oh? Where's Ichigo-chan?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.810
Yeah, I would have thought she'd be the first to show up...

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.810
But they're so delicious, I can't stop!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.520
You'd better leave some for Vanilla, or...

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.520
Hey, Amano!

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:59.820
What's with this mountain of strawberry tarts?

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:02.680
You sure made a lot...

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.490
I guess we know what's for dinner tonight...

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:10.560
I tried to come up with my own strawberry tart, but nothing seems just right...

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.290
Really? They look good to me.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.240
Will you try tasting one?

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.540
I'll try, too!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.600
Caramel!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.830
You're going to eat more?

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.010
This isn't bad at all.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:25.720
Isn't this quite close to completion?

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:30.930
Yeah, but it tastes pretty ordinary, like you'd find most anywhere.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:32.930
Ordinary...

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.940
You don't have to be so blunt!

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.940
But I have to be!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:45.720
When you think of the level the World Cake Grand Prix is at, this strawberry tart doesn't stand a chance!

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.780
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:56.770
I wanted to try my best on my own without relying on my grandma's recipe, but in the end, this is the best I can do...

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.460
But you've come this far already...

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.720
All you need to do now is make them even more delicious and you'll be fine.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:10.970
Tart crust is generally split into three categories: pâte sucrée, butter foncer, and pâte sablée.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.810
These are pâte sucrée, yes?

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.050
Yeah...

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.880
I wanted a tart with a darker baked colour.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.320
I see.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:23.200
I also think pâte sucrée is the best choice for strawberry tarts.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:27.070
The cream that's inside the tart is crème pâtissière?

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:30.360
Although I detect a hint of crème d'amandes.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.530
Actually, I blended the two types of creams.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.730
Crème frangipane, then?

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:39.000
Fra... Zipang?

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:44.000
Ichigo-chan... You made it without knowing what it was?

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.400
You know, I'm greedy like that,

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.280
so I thought "wouldn't it be nice if I could taste both kinds of cream..."

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:53.010
and when I mixed them that's what I got.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.610
The delicate taste of crème frangipane...

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:58.630
...goes perfectly with fruit.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:01.520
It's the ultimate combination.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.860
So basically the tart crust and cream are made decently enough.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.570
Decent enough...

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.030
Which means...

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:14.740
It's the strawberries set on top, or the confiture you made with them that has room for improvement.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:19.460
Yeah, it's just as you say, Kashino. Those are the parts I'm not happy with.

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:22.880
Isn't it because you used cheap strawberries?

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.790
Ichigo wouldn't use something like that!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:28.790
Yeah... The strawberries themselves aren't the problem.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:32.260
I can't eat any more...

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:37.470
If only I had those strawberries that grandma grew...

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.620
That taste really was special...

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.190
Do you remember what kind they were?

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.710
I was just a kid... I didn't pay attention to that sort of thing.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:48.950
I see.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:52.120
But if you're looking for strawberries, we'll help you.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:53.360
We just have to look carefully.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.840
Thank you.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:58.520
But I'll search for the strawberries myself.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.160
I'm not sure I'll be able to find any, however...

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:01.500
Amano!

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:07.070
What are we going to do if you're so negative during the finals?

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.740
Those feelings will show up in the sweets you create!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.820
As you are now, your sweets won't make anyone smile.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.890
All they'll do is make people uneasy.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:21.860
I...

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:23.640
Ichigo...

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.650
I'm gonna get some fresh air!

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.650
Wait, Ichigo!

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:27.920
Should we go after her?

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:31.690
Don't worry. Amano isn't as weak as she once was.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:35.990
W-What?

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.550
I know it's the weekend, but it sure is quiet.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.910
There should at least be some people around...

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.910
Well, that's for the best I suppose.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.090
Oh, what am I saying!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.560
Delicious!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.390
The flavour permeates completely!

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.870
It makes me happy from the bottom of my heart.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:02.270
Senpai...

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:04.280
No, I mean, Miya!

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:08.980
Will you make me such delicious meals for breakfast and dinner, everyday?

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:13.190
For you, Makoto-kun, I will make them even if the world is destroyed!

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.230
Miya!

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:16.450
Makoto-kun!

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.760
Our love is the greatest in the world...

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:21.470
No, the greatest in the universe!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.660
It'll be so, totally just like that!

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:28.720
What am I to do?

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.340
Although it was the Koshiro's personal chef Tamae-san who made the lunch...

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:29.370
"Miya!"

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:30.420
What is it, Darling?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.670
"I love you!"

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.620
It vexes me, but Kashino is right.

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.220
Ichigo...

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:41.930
Energy, okay!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.640
Smile, okay!

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.140
Wait for me, Darling!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.650
That was mean, Ichigo!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.970
Koshiro-san!

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:52.360
Amano Ichigo...

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.120
Why are you here, Marron?

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.600
And why shouldn't I be?

00:09:58.740 --> 00:09:59.670
What?

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.310
What's going on?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:09.610
Huh?

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:10.720
This is...

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.240
The Kingdom of Sweets?

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.050
But, why?

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.230
What the heck is this?

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:20.550
I've gotten all ugly like Marron!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.220
Well, sorry for being so ugly, then.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.710
What happened to my slender legs?

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:31.730
I know! This must be some sort of plot!

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.320
My dad will pay whatever ransom you want!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.120
So just please, hurry and turn me back to normal!

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:41.280
Satou! Shiotani! Save me!

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.370
Now, now... Calm down, Koshiro-san.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.520
Oh! It's Amano Ichigo!

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:45.820
Why haven't you changed a bit?

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:49.110
Uh, I think I've changed quite a bit, actually...

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:51.400
I got it...

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:52.960
This is all part of your evil scheme, right?

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.420
You were jealous and cast some kind of strange curse on me, right?

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.380
Well, I can't blame you. That's obviously it!

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.410
I didn't cast any curse!

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:00.550
You guys again?

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:02.930
If you're coming, don't make such a huge fuss!

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.520
Makoto-kun!

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.600
Makoto-kun! Makoto-kun! Makoto-kun! Makoto-kun! Makoto-kun!

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:06.570
Who the heck are you?

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.600
I suddenly feel pissed off.

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.580
Ichigo-chan!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:14.750
I asked the guard at the gate, and they said that no girls have left.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:18.280
Thank goodness. That means she's still somewhere in the academy.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:23.690
So after the clock glowed, you ended up here.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:30.210
I have heard that the main Paris campus of St. Marie Academy is deeply connected to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.460
There are probably plenty of gates you can enter in from around the school.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.630
Sheesh, where did she go?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.210
This is because of what you said to her, Kashino.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:43.980
I was just trying to cheer her up, by telling her not to be weak.

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:45.130
That was cheering her up?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.390
What?

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:50.700
You really don't understand girls' feelings, do you?

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.100
What a complete oaf!

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.310
S-Sorry about that...

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.400
Umm, isn't this...

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.670
That's Koshiro-senpai's.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.900
Her questionable doll...

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:19.590
But if you're so weak your sweets won't make anyone smile. All they'll do is make people uneasy.

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:23.130
I knew he'd say the same thing...

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:27.110
I really do pity you commoners.

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:31.350
With my dad's connections I can get as much top quality fruit as I want!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.770
That's it!

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:35.430
Koshiro-san!

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:38.570
Please let me have some top-quality strawberries!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.720
Please!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:43.650
Hmm, yes... I don't mind assisting you.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:47.070
After all, President Tennouji and I are fated rivals.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.290
And besides...

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.010
If it goes well...

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:55.300
We won thanks to these incredible strawberries you prepared for us!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.230
Thank you, Miya!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.470
Or something like that!

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:04.130
Makoto-kun, you're so bold!

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.090
What's with her?

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:09.010
Fine! I will assist you!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:16.520
But if you want to collect the best strawberries, it would be best to go to Japan where my Papa has the most influence.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:20.360
Don't worry about that! I have a good idea.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:25.810
This toy train connects to the Japan campus of St. Marie Academy after all, right?

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.370
Let's go to Japan, then!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:32.480
Did you do it again?

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:35.320
How many eggs have you broken today?

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.790
Four.

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.970
Madarina, Urerina, Disappear!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.290
Amazing!

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:59.810
I've collected pretty much all the best strawberries from around the world.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:04.110
I'm so happy I get to taste them all...

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.320
Please don't forget the original goal here!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.830
That's right, Ichigo! We can't take too much time.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:11.830
I know, I know...

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.830
That hit the spot!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:19.490
I didn't actually think you'd eat <i>all</i> of them.

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:21.880
Her stomach is quite mysterious.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.370
So?

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:26.260
Was there a strawberry that fits the image for your tart?

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.820
Of course there was!

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:32.260
I collected every top strawberry in the world, after all!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.820
There has to be one that works.

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:35.560
Well...

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:40.980
I don't know how to say this, but there wasn't one that fit the image I'm thinking of.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:44.190
Inconceivable!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:47.640
Those are the best of the best from around the world!

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:50.530
There aren't any strawberries with better quality than these!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.500
The strawberries I ate in my grandmother's garden...

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:59.310
Yes... They were almost as if they were the treasures of the forest!

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:04.880
Carefully grown among the grandness of nature, the taste of the earth!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.210
As I thought,

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:12.090
none of the strawberries here could be better than the taste of my grandmother's...

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.370
Okay, now this is pissing me off...

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:19.810
If you can't find a strawberry you like, then make a blueberry or apple tart or some other type of tart!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.700
She can't do that!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.940
Then why don't we just go to your grandmother's garden?

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:31.860
You <i>so</i> owe me for this, it'll definitely cost you later!

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.140
And don't you forget it!

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.540
Thank you so much, Koshiro-san! I'll do anything to make it up to you!

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:44.470
I can't believe it, we're really here...

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.730
Koshiro-san, this is just too amazing!

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.320
You just figured this out now?

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:54.080
Well, things that are just dreams to
commoners, I can make happen for real!

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:58.160
Oh, I remember!

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.630
This is your grandmother's shop.

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:04.320
And now the shop is run by your shiny-headed uncle!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.070
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.470
You came here once before, didn't you Vanilla?

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:08.900
Yeah!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.830
Hey...

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:14.910
What did we come out here to this remote place in my helicopter again for?

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.700
"Remote place?"

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.310
My grandma's garden was in this backyard...

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.410
Garden? Here?

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:25.000
It's full of weeds.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.920
It just looks like a wild field to me.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:34.010
My uncle's busy with the shop, and he said that he wasn't any good at gardening.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:38.300
Then, even if we come here, we aren't going to get any strawberries...

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:39.790
Well...

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.570
It's just...

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:47.090
The more I search for strawberries, the more this garden comes to mind...

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:51.220
It's like my grandma is calling me...

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.450
That's how I feel.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.550
Yes...

00:16:56.970 --> 00:17:00.510
I have a feeling I've forgotten something important.

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:01.410
But, what?

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:06.290
The ones here are planted in special soil I brought in from another place.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:07.980
That's it!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:11.530
Isn't it a waste of time coming here?

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.130
What are you doing, Ichigo?

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:19.740
It's covered in weeds, so I can't be sure... But I think it's around here.

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:20.810
What is?

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:25.560
There should be a patch of soil a different colour here...

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:29.130
The strawberries from there were especially delicious...

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:32.320
So that's where the secret of your grandmother's strawberries is?

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.260
Maybe...

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.820
I'll help, too!

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:38.990
Hey, haven't you had enough? Let's go back.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.150
Miya, look what I found!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:48.020
It may be this overgrown, but it's the garden my grandma loved so dearly...

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:51.970
I'm sure that some fragments of that love must still be here!

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.600
Here! This is the soil!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.770
You found it, Ichigo!

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.470
It's alive...

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:06.100
This strawberry vine is still alive!

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:14.260
This sweetness that just grips you with nature!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.990
There can be no mistake!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:19.820
These are the strawberries that my grandma let me eat when I was little!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.480
They're pretty small...

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:25.430
What kind of strawberries are these?

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:26.580
They're fraises de bois.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.810
Fraises de bois...

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:31.810
They're European strawberries known as "woodland strawberries".

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.590
Now that you mention it...

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:39.070
I saw fraises de bois at the morning market in Paris that the landlady told me about.

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:43.140
But since they were oddly shaped and small, I didn't pay any attention to them.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:47.480
You were just searching for the best looking strawberries for the Grand Prix.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.690
No wonder you didn't find them from the top-class ones I gathered.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:59.030
So Ichigo's grandma went and brought soil from France just to raise these fraises de bois...

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:00.860
Not a chance.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:04.080
It's strictly forbidden to bring in soil from other countries.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:07.850
Then where did this soil come from?

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:12.290
This is the soil that's used in the Kingdom of Sweets's plantation.

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:16.300
It's definitely similar to the soil in France.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:20.650
Marron, I'm surprised that you knew it was the soil in the Kingdom of Sweets plantation.

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:23.850
Kashi once made fun of me...

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:27.850
He said that the ingredients grown in this soil for sweets get really tasty.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:30.980
Grandma...

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:35.960
These fraises de bois that continued to stay alive...

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:39.860
They're a present from you, right?

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:43.240
Thank you, grandma!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.410
She's way too slow...

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:49.270
She still won't answer her cellphone?

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.670
No, it's no use.

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:56.130
I contacted the landlady, but she said she hasn't come back the apartment yet.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:19:58.920
Amano...

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.420
I'm back!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.680
Amano-san!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.350
Welcome back, Ichigo-chan!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.970
Where did you go?

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.640
Everyone was really worried about you.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.490
Sorry! A lot of stuff happened!

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.040
Pardon the intrusion!

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:15.520
Koshiro-senpai?

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:18.870
Fraises de bois?

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:26.440
They're aren't the most beautiful looking strawberries, but they are a very sweet strawberry with a great, natural taste.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.290
They really are the perfect strawberry for you, Ichigo-chan.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.870
But still, you sure did great finding your grandmother's strawberries.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:38.590
Yeah! And it's all thanks to Koshiro-san!

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:42.620
Well, I wanted to help Makoto-kun win, see...

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:44.770
So I, like, did all I could!

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.010
Koshiro-senpai!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.510
Thank you very much!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.440
It's all for you, Makoto-kun!

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:55.280
And I have another surprise for you.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.900
I brought you food!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:02.800
They were packed in Château confectionery's special refrigerated boxes, so they haven't gone bad!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.880
Makoto-kun!

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:08.510
Yes, this is Kashino.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.570
Chairman?

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:12.170
Yes?

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.160
Team Tennouji lost in the semifinals!?

