00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:06.440
The difference between France and Japan's strawberries.

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:10.950
Strawberries are used in Western confectionery.

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:17.950
They are often used due to their aroma, sweetness, and their cute appearance.

00:23:19.100 --> 00:23:24.960
Well then, are there differences between a France one and a Japan one?

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:29.920
The most famous France strawberry is called gariguette.

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:33.020
This gariguette is very fragrant with a rather tangy taste, but...

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:39.360
...it's a little deficient on sweetness, so it's usually used after it has been processed.

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:43.790
So for example, if it's used to make berry jam or sorbet, it would taste delicious.

00:23:44.700 --> 00:23:53.910
On the other hand, Japan strawberries itself are already sweet, so they're more often used directly as decoration on shortcakes.

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:59.910
Changing the type of strawberries along with different methods of usage is a good idea too.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:04.880
What have I been chasing after all this time?

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:08.410
Your shadow? Or maybe an illusion?

00:24:08.410 --> 00:24:11.260
Maybe it was all a dream...

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:14.590
These endless, overflowing tears...

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:15.850
A dream...

